# 1.2 x 10^7 levels of small frames take the stack to its largest size,
# then 7 x 10^6 levels of frames 2-3x bigger on the same stack: stops
# cleanly (a limit computed from the first recursion only let Go's stack
# overflow, exit status 2)
status 3
stderr elan: recursion too deep
small 12000000 1000 7000000 500
compilers elanc-rs elanc-go
